  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Quiet personal workspace",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"Quiet personal workspace\"**\n\nThis description records the incumbent interface; the source tokens below define the system.\n\nThe web app is an Operate surface. It keeps attention on the current conversation or task while the sidebar provides stable orientation. Geist, cool neutral surfaces, and a restrained violet brand accent make state changes legible without turning the workspace into a dashboard of competing signals.\n\n**Key Characteristics:** calm, task-first, state-explicit, keyboard-friendly, responsive.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "calm",
      "task-first",
      "state-explicit",
      "keyboard-friendly",
      "responsive"
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep the primary task visible in the middle column.",
      "Do make recovery, waiting, and offline states explicit in words.",
      "Do reuse `packages/theme/theme.css` and the existing UI primitives.",
      "Do preserve keyboard order and 44px mobile hit areas.",
      "Do keep task metrics contextual to the task overview; the existing 28px metric masthead is not a conversation pattern.",
      "Do retain the existing Bot identity halo and task overview gradient as incumbent patterns; additions require a surface-specific reason."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't use color alone for status.",
      "Don't create one-off spacing or component variants when an existing primitive fits."
    ]
  }
